{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港股走勢反覆向下。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">科網股拖低大市，阿里下試105元水平，騰訊也跌百分之1。汽車股有沽壓，內地發布電池發展規劃，吉利急挫百分之7。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T05:59:54.616982+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":65,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}